  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Your unstable power twists violently whenever you strike. After you make an attack roll using a power or a weapon that deals energy damage, you may <strong>spend any number of Echoes</strong> to empower it. Choose one or more of the following effects, depending on the Echo spent:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Harm (1 Echo):</strong> Gain 1d10 extra damage on the damage roll.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pain (1 Echo):</strong> The target must also mark a Stress.</p></li><li><p><strong>Confusion (2 Echoes):</strong> The target is temporarily <em>Distracted</em>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Crippled (2 Echoes):</strong> The target is temporarily <em>Weakened</em>.</p></li></ul><p>You can only choose each effect once. After using this feature, roll a <strong>d4</strong>. If the result is equal to or lower than the number of Echo you spent, <strong>mark a Stress</strong>.</p>",
